    {
      "source": "Parse a string to a <code>WriteConcern</code>. If it is a well know <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> as identified by the\n<code>WriteConcern.valueOf(String)</code>, use the well known <code>WriteConcern</code> value, otherwise pass the string as is\nto the constructor of the write concern. There is no support for other constructor signatures when parsing from a\nstring value.",
      "translation": "将字符串解析为 `<code>WriteConcern`。如果该字符串是已知的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>（由<code>WriteConcern.valueOf(String)</code>识别），则使用已知的 `<code>WriteConcern` 值；否则，将字符串原样传递给写关心的构造函数。从字符串值解析时不支持其他构造函数签名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
